# Cosmetic source assets — canonical copies live in web/public/cosmetics (avatars/icons)
# and Cloudflare R2 (backgrounds, via api/scripts/upload-cosmetics). Keys/manifest are
# committed (api/content/cosmetics.json); the large/binary sources are not.
/default-avatars/
/premium-icons/
/mykurda-background/

# Where source artwork is dropped for conversion (sticker PNGs, the empty-state
# drawings). The files that ship are generated from these: sized WebPs under
# web/public/stickers, and the four PNGs under mobile/assets/empty.
# Ignored so a `git add -A` cannot sweep multi-megabyte originals into a commit.
/stickers/
/empty/
/kurdistan_filter.png
